      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really solid start, I like the vibe. The imagery is good.\n\nActually, I just checked the draft against the tool and it's scoring a bit lower than I'd hoped. It's technically \"passable,\" but our brand standard usually requires a higher richness quotient to get through the board. \n\nCan we try a version that really leans into that \"vocabulary richness\"? You don't have to make it messy—keep it elegant and flowing like the first one—but let's push the adjective count significantly higher. Just make sure it still feels like a luxury brand and not a list of words.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
